    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Shootout is a top-down, roguelike shooter set in a stadium on an alien world. Leave a wake of destruction with powerful pickups sent down by the roaring crowd. Fight, die, and fight again to the top of the\u00a0online leaderboard, and face off against three distinct bosses who would rather kick off in a blaze of glory\u00a0than give up their fame and fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, twin stick shooting action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in randomization makes every run unique, including the soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes against three deadly bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three special weapon pickups will save your behind just when you need them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise through the online leaderboard as your name becomes legend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too hard or too easy? Three difficulty settings will keep it juuust right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full gamepad support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends in two-player local co-op</p></li></ul>",
